<title>USA: Innovative Tech awarded $500,000 order.</title>
<headline>Innovative Tech awarded $500,000 order.</headline>
<dateline>WARMINSTER, Pa. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innovative Tech Systems Inc said on Friday that it has been awarded purchase orders totaling $525,264 to upgrade current SPAN-FM Inspection Manager systems and for the purchase of 56 new Inspection Manager systems.</p>
<p>The Inspection Manager systems were ordered for all newly acquired properties of real estate developer Simon DeBartolo Group, Innovative said in a statement.</p>
<p>Innovative Tech Systems is the developer of SPAN-FM software and remote data collection systems.</p>
</text>
